OrcaCode Review
Copyright 2026 OrcaRouter

This product uses Open Code Review ("ocr"), an open-source code review tool by
Alibaba Group, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

    https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review

In two ways:

1. The GitHub Action installs the published Open Code Review package and runs
   it as the LLM review engine. This product adds, on top of it: OrcaRouter
   gateway integration, a cost-tiered model cascade, a severity rubric
   (P0/P1/P2/P3), and merge-gating.

2. The local review (`review plan` / `review submit`) does NOT run Open Code
   Review — the reviewer is the user's own coding agent. It reuses Open Code
   Review's file-selection rules and per-language review checklists:

   - vendor/open-code-review/     data copied unmodified from upstream at the
                                  tag recorded in vendor/open-code-review/UPSTREAM,
                                  with its LICENSE
   - bin/selection.mjs            a JavaScript port of the matching logic, a
                                  modified work; the Go sources it derives from
                                  are named in its header

